	"FriendlyName": "Shared World",
	"Description": "Play one shared multiplayer world with friends. Press Play Shared World: it joins the friend who is hosting, or downloads the latest save and hosts. Runs entirely inside the game; the world is stored in a GitHub repository or a shared folder.",
